  "statuteText": "198:40-d Annual Adjustment. –\n\nBeginning July 1, 2026, and every year thereafter, the department of education shall adjust the following with an increase of 2 percent annually, rounded up to the nearest whole dollar:\nI. Per pupil costs in RSA 198:40-a, II; and\nII. Chartered public school additional grants under RSA 194-B:11, I(b)(1)(A) and (B)."
